Patch from MiniMyth2 project

Developed-by: Piotr Oniszczuk <piotr.oniszczuk@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Piotr Oniszczuk <piotr.oniszczuk@gmail.com>




On A95X F3 Air II (S905Y4, vendor u-boot, MiniArch kernel with the S4 DRM patches), anything on the overlay plane 
(plane 40, VD1) came out as luma only: a strong green picture, chroma effectively zero.
The primary plane (OSD) is fine; modetest SMPTE bars on the primary plane are perfect.

It does not depend on the video source. A plain test pattern shows the same:

gst-launch-1.0 videotestsrc pattern=smpte ! video/x-raw,format=NV12,width=1280,height=720 ! kmssink driver-name=meson plane-id=40
It happens with NV12 and YUY2, with and without scaling. The VD1 format registers at the S4 
addresses (FMT_CTRL 0x481d, FMT_W 0x481e, GEN_REG2 0x4819) were already correct.

Root cause: the same issue as the existing upstream fix "drm/meson: fix colour distortion from HDR 
set during vendor u-boot", but for the video planes. 

The vendor u-boot leaves the HDR2 block enabled on VD1/VD2. The driver clears it only for OSD1:

OSD1_HDR2_CTRL (0x38a0) = 0x0000C04F   <- cleared by meson_viu_init()
VD1_HDR2_CTRL  (0x3800) = 0x0000E05F   <- bit 13 still set by vendor u-boot
VD2_HDR2_CTRL  (0x3850) = 0x0000E05F

Clearing bits 13 and 16 on VD1/VD2 (0xE05F -> 0xC05F) at runtime fixes it. 
Colours become correct immediately, and 1080p60 H.264 plays in real time on plane 40 with correct colours.

Issue identified by domeneponuda-beep
Fix also developed by domeneponuda-beep
May thx for this!


diff --speed-large-files --no-dereference --minimal -Naur linux-7.3.1/drivers/gpu/drm/meson/meson_viu.c linux-7.3.1/drivers/gpu/drm/meson/meson_viu.c
--- linux-7.3.1/drivers/gpu/drm/meson/meson_viu.c	2026-11-04 18:24:27.449318848 +0100
+++ linux-7.3.1/drivers/gpu/drm/meson/meson_viu.c	2026-11-04 18:23:48.674230615 +0100
@@ -59,6 +59,9 @@
 #define EOTF_COEFF_SIZE 10
 #define EOTF_COEFF_RIGHTSHIFT 1
 
+#define VD1_HDR2_CTRL 0x3800
+#define VD2_HDR2_CTRL 0x3850
+
 static int RGB709_to_YUV709l_coeff[MATRIX_5X3_COEF_SIZE] = {
 	0, 0, 0, /* pre offset */
 	COEFF_NORM(0.181873),	COEFF_NORM(0.611831),	COEFF_NORM(0.061765),
@@ -498,6 +501,14 @@
 				    priv->io_base + _REG(DOLBY_PATH_CTRL));
 
 		meson_viu_g12a_disable_osd1_afbc(priv);
+
+		/* same vendor u-boot HDR2 leftover on the video planes */
+		writel_bits_relaxed(OSD1_HDR2_CTRL_REG_ONLY_MAT |
+				    OSD1_HDR2_CTRL_VDIN0_HDR2_TOP_EN, 0,
+				    priv->io_base + _REG(VD1_HDR2_CTRL));
+		writel_bits_relaxed(OSD1_HDR2_CTRL_REG_ONLY_MAT |
+				    OSD1_HDR2_CTRL_VDIN0_HDR2_TOP_EN, 0,
+				    priv->io_base + _REG(VD2_HDR2_CTRL));
 	}
 
 	if (meson_vpu_is_compatible(priv, VPU_COMPATIBLE_GXM))
